{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["מִקְּדַשׁ — the qof of מקדש has a dagesh and the dalet is rafeh, and likewise ״הַצְּפִינוֹ״. And likewise מִשְּׁתֵי עיני מפלשתים. The dagesh that is in the qof of מקדש causes the hatef (in it) to be realized. And therefore the dalet after it is rafeh. And likewise הצפינו. And likewise משתי."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:41:38.600153637Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}